/ActualText (On the occasion of 10th International Day of Yoga, AVNL had participated in the  open air yoga  session at Ajeya Stadium, Avadi organised by HVF.   Shri Sanjay Dwivedi, CMD, AVNL, Shri  V R Rambhad, CGM, HVF, Group A and Group B officers, employees, and their family  members had done Yoga practice during the session.)
