/S /P
/ActualText (On 13th May, 2024, HVF Avadi proudly hosted the rolling out ceremony of a batch of T-90 Mark III tanks. The event was virtually inaugurated by Lt. Gen. Vivek Kashyap, AVSM, VSM \(Director General of Armoured Corps\) & Shri Sanjay Dwivedi, CMD AVNL. Brig. Bharadwaj, CQA\(AVA\), Brig. Shriram Kumar, CQA\(HV\), Mr. Rabin Medak, ADG/DQA\(CV\), Shri. C Ramachandran, Director/Finance, AVNL, Shri.Anurag Kumar Sharma, CGM/EFA, Shri.V.R.Rambhad, CGM/HVF, Shri. Gireesh Babu, GM/HVF, Shri. M. Sivakumar, GM HVF & Shri Naik, CQA\(AVL\) and others had attended the rolling out ceremony.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
