/ActualText (On June 28, 2024, AVNL entered into an agreement with BEL \(Bharat Electronics Limited\) to supply 693 fire control systems and sighting systems for the armament upgrade of BMP-2. Shri Sanjay Dwivedi \(CMD/AVNL\), Shri Bhanu Prakash Srivastava \(Director/Operations, BEL\), Shri Ramchandran \(Director Finance / AVNL\), Shri K. Sudhakar \(CGM/OFMK\), Shri Pedro \(Executive Director/BEL\), and other senior officers from both the PSUs were present on the above occasion. )
