<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (On May 6th, 2024, Shri Sanjay Kumar Jha, CMD MIDHANI, a Public Sector Undertaking under the Department of Defence Production, MoD, paid a visit to the AVNL Corporate Office. Shri  Shri Sanjay Dwivedi, CMD AVNL welcomed the CMD/MIDHANI. During the visit, Shri N.Gowri Shankar Rao,  Director/Finance at MIDHANI met Shri C. Ramachandran, Director/Finance, AVNL CO. Among the topics, an MoU between MIDHANI and AVNL for establishing an Armour production facility and the indiginisation of Armoured Steel for defence applications were discussed. MIDHANI is a well-known manufacturer of super alloys, titanium alloys and special-purpose steels that are required for strategic sectors such as Defence, Space and Aeronautics. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
